#: includes/WIYCW-admin.php:91
msgid "Widget"
msgstr "Джаджа"

#: includes/WIYCW-admin.php:92
msgid "Go to Appearance > Widgets (or the Customizer) and add “Weather Widget Pro” to a sidebar. If your theme has no widget areas, use the block or the shortcode."
